      '## 6. Core Web Vitals Synergies: Shipping Zero-Bloat Frontend Bundles',
      'The primary reason traditional enterprise sites fail Google\'s Core Web Vitals is the uncontrolled accumulation of third-party plugins. A typical WordPress site loads 40 to 60 separate JavaScript files just to power sliders, social icons, and forms.',
