      '2. **Engineered On-Demand Tag Invalidation**: Built automated webhook pipelines reducing content update propagation latency from 45 minutes to 420 milliseconds.',
      '3. **Implemented Global Edge Caching**: Distributed static HTML assets across 285 CDN edge locations with automatic fallback to stale cache during origin blips.',
